---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${COMPANY.name}`}
  description="Privacy information for the MODH07 LIMITED website."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main" class="bg-paper">
    <article class="wrap prose-page py-16 sm:py-24">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>
        This page describes how the MODH07 LIMITED website currently handles
        information. It is written for a basic informational website. It is not
        a substitute for tailored legal advice.
      </p>
      <p>
        Last updated: 19 August 2026.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is published by {COMPANY.name}, a private limited company
        registered in England and Wales (Company No. {COMPANY.number}). The
        registered office is {COMPANY.address.line1}, {COMPANY.address.locality},
        {COMPANY.address.region}, {COMPANY.address.postcode}.
      </p>

      <h2>What this website does</h2>
      <p>
        This is a static informational website. It does not include user
        accounts, payment processing, analytics tools, or advertising networks
        as part of the current build.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact form</h2>
      <p>
        The website includes a contact form for layout and future use. The form
        is not connected to an email service, database, or API. Completing the
        form does not transmit or store your details.
      </p>
      <p>
        <!-- TODO: When a form service is connected, document: what data is collected, why it is collected, the legal basis, how long it is kept, who it is shared with, and how to request access or deletion. -->
        When a form or messaging service is added later, this policy will need
        to be updated with the actual processing details.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not set analytics or advertising cookies as part of
        the current static build. The hosting provider may process technical
        logs (such as IP address, browser type and requested pages) as part of
        delivering the site.
      </p>
      <p>
        <!-- TODO: If analytics, chat widgets, or a form provider that sets cookies are added, list those cookies and update this section. -->
        If cookies or similar technologies are introduced later, this section
        should be updated before those tools go live.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        If personal data is processed in the future, individuals in the UK may
        have rights under UK data protection law, including rights of access,
        correction and deletion, subject to legal limits.
      </p>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, contact {COMPANY.owner} at
        <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a>
        or write to the registered office address above.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        This policy may be updated when the website’s functionality changes,
        particularly if a contact form service, analytics, or other processing
        is introduced.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
